<title>USA: National Media names chairman.</title>
<headline>National Media names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Media Corp said Thursday Frederick Hammer has been named board chairman.</p>
<p>Hammer, a partner of Inter-Atlantic Securities Corp, has been a member of National Media's board since 1994 and replaces Ira Lubert, who was serving as interim chairman, and who will remain as a director.</p>
<p>Hammer was formerly executive vice president at Chase Manhattan Bank, where his responsibilities included global consumer activities.</p>
